9m directly doesn't    \u001b[14;6H\u001b[1K\u001b[Cwork: the browser blocks loading the links from a plain    \u001b[15;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[6G\u001b[1K\u001b[Cfile.\u001b[16;4H\u001b[1K\u001b[C- Run both roles in ask-before-acting mode.                  \u001b[17;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[18;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[CPress \u001b[38;5;153ma\u001b[39m in the panel to approve, or \u001b[38;5;153mc\u001b[39m to tell me what to       \u001b[19;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[2G\u001b[1K\u001b[Cchange.\u001b[20;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mCooked for 38s · done 9:02 PM\u001b[39m                                  \u001b[22;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[48;5;237m\r\n❯ \u001b[38;5;231mplan approved in the panel. Continue the mission.\u001b[39m              \u001b[49m\u001b[24;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;114m\r\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[m\u000f(troupe stage build && troupe dispatch docs)               \u001b[38;5;246m\r\n  ⎿  \u001b[39mStage: build                                                \u001b[27;5H\u001b[1K\u001b[CDispatched docs to %218; /home/tizh/repos/projects/trou     \r\n     pe-demo/.troupe/worktrees/readme/docs on role/readme/do     \r\n     cs                                                          \u001b[38;5;246m\r\n  ⎿  Allowed by auto mode classifier\u001b[39m                             \u001b[31;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;231m\r\n●\u001b[39m The \u001b[38;5;153mdocs\u001b[39m role is now writing the README in its own window, in  \r\n  the \u001b[38;5;153mroles-readme\u001b[39m tmux window. If it stops on a permission      \r\n  prompt, the panel shows it as waiting on you. I'll send it to  \u001b[35;2H\u001b[1K\u001b[Creview when it finishes.                                       \u001b[36;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mCooked for 4s · done 9:02 PM\u001b[39m                                   \u001b[38;65H\u001b[1K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[